[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":57},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":55,"_13":55,"_38":56},"id","basico-face-amarela","nome","Yellow face","rascunho",false,"html","<p>With the yellow <a href=\"/en/glossary#cruz\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The 4 edges of one face (usually white) in place, lined up with the centers. The first step of the beginner method and of CFOP.\">cross</a> done, the top corners need to be turned so the whole face is yellow. A single algorithm solves it: the <strong><a href=\"/en/glossary#sune\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Two short OLL algorithms that orient 3 corners: R U R' U R U2 R' (Sune) and R U2 R' U' R U' R' (Anti-Sune).\">Sune</a></strong>, <code>R U R&#39; U R U2 R&#39;</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/95d89913d1a57f8f.svg\" alt=\"The goal: the top face all yellow (the sides don't matter yet).\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal: the top face all yellow (the sides don&#39;t matter yet).</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Count the yellow corners</h2>\n<p>Look at the top and count how many corners already have yellow facing up.</p>\n<p><strong>One corner</strong> (the fish): turn the top (<code>U</code>) until that corner is at the <strong>front left</strong>. Do the Sune.</p>\n<p><strong>No corners or two corners</strong>: turn the top until the front left corner has its yellow facing <strong>to the left</strong>. Do the Sune.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/d9d5c2e88cb35864.svg\" alt=\"Fish: the yellow corner at the front left. 1 Sune.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Fish: the yellow corner at the front left. 1 Sune.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U R U2 R' R U R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/dc76e3b497212869.svg\" alt=\"None: the front left yellow facing left. 2 Sunes.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>None: the front left yellow facing left. 2 Sunes.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U R U2 R' R U R' U R U2 R' R U R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/d8b7151c0563c65f.svg\" alt=\"Two: the front left yellow facing left. 3 Sunes.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Two: the front left yellow facing left. 3 Sunes.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>After the Sune, look again and repeat the rule. In at most 3 Sunes the face is yellow. Click a diagram to see the rule repeating on the 3D cube.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;oll&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"R U R' U R U2 R'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-5.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U2</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2e347328925a6810-7.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The Sune on the fish.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>To memorize the Sune: start like the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a>, but with <code>U</code> at the end instead of <code>U&#39;</code> (<code>R U R&#39; U</code>), and finish with <code>R U2 R&#39;</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> if at the end a single corner is left with its yellow turned, and the Sune doesn&#39;t solve it, the cube was put together wrong: that corner is twisted. Take the corner out, put it back with yellow facing up and continue.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Shortcuts</h2>\n<p>The cards of this step give a recipe for each of the 7 shapes, with the Sune and the Anti-Sune (the Sune backwards). That way you get it right the first time, without looking again between one and the other.</p>\n","treino","/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/face-amarela/casos","metodos",[51],"anterior",{"_13":49,"_38":50},"proximo",{"_13":47,"_38":48},"grupos",[29],{"_11":30,"_13":14,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":16,"_36":37,"_38":39},"Passo 5","nivel","iniciante","casos",7,"conjunto","ids",[40,41,42,43,44,45,46],"endereco","/3x3/basico/face-amarela/casos","B5-Peixe-Sune","B5-Peixe-Anti-Sune","B5-Cruz-H","B5-Pi","B5-Farois","B5-T","B5-Gravata","Corners in place","/3x3/basico/cantos","Yellow cross","/3x3/basico/cruz-amarela",{"_13":52,"_53":34,"_38":54},"Beginner method","numero","/3x3/basico#face-amarela","3x3","/3x3/",{"_58":59,"_60":61},"cubos",[64,65,66,67,68,69],"idiomas",[62,63],"pt","en",{"_11":55,"_13":55},{"_11":76,"_13":76},{"_11":75,"_13":75},{"_11":74,"_13":74},{"_11":72,"_13":73},{"_11":70,"_13":71},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2"]
